    %% Request Flow
    REQ1 -->|1. get_client(K0Port.COMMAND, trace_id)| MGR
    REQ2 -->|2. get_client(K0Port.QUERY, trace_id)| MGR
    REQ3 -->|3. get_client(K0Port.SSE, trace_id)| MGR
    REQ4 -->|4. get_client(K0Port.OBS, trace_id)| MGR
    
    %% Cache Lookup
    MGR -->|Check cache| CACHE_CMD
    MGR -->|Check cache| CACHE_QRY
    MGR -->|Check cache| CACHE_SSE
    MGR -->|Check cache| CACHE_OBS
    
    %% Cache Hit/Miss
    CACHE_CMD -.->|Hit: Reuse| HTTP2_CONN
    CACHE_QRY -.->|Miss: Create new| HTTP2_CONN
    CACHE_SSE -.->|Hit: Reuse| HTTP2_CONN
    CACHE_OBS -.->|Hit: Reuse| HTTP2_CONN
    
    %% Stream Multiplexing
    HTTP2_CONN -->|Multiplex| STREAM1
    HTTP2_CONN -->|Multiplex| STREAM2
    HTTP2_CONN -->|Multiplex| STREAM3
    
    %% K0 Connection
    STREAM1 -.->|HTTP/2 POST| K0_CMD
    STREAM2 -.->|HTTP/2 GET| K0_SSE
    STREAM3 -.->|HTTP/2 POST| K0_OBS
    
    K0_CMD --> K0
    K0_QRY --> K0
    K0_SSE --> K0
    K0_OBS --> K0
    K0_HEALTH --> K0
    
    %% Health Check Flow
    HEALTH_TASK -->|Every 30s| HEALTH_STATE
    HEALTH_STATE -.->|HEAD /health| K0_HEALTH
    K0_HEALTH -.->|200 OK (12ms)| HEALTH_STATE
    HEALTH_STATE -->|If OK| HEALTH_FAIL
    HEALTH_FAIL -.->|Reset count| HEALTH_STATE
    
    %% Health Failure Flow
    HEALTH_STATE -.->|3 consecutive failures| HEALTH_FAIL
    HEALTH_FAIL -.->|Evict all| CACHE_CMD
    HEALTH_FAIL -.->|Evict all| CACHE_QRY
    HEALTH_FAIL -.->|Evict all| CACHE_SSE
    HEALTH_FAIL -.->|Evict all| CACHE_OBS
    
    %% Eviction Flow
    EVICT_TASK -->|Every 60s| EVICT_RULE
    EVICT_RULE -->|Check TTL| CACHE_QRY
    CACHE_QRY -.->|75s > 60s| EVICT_LOG
    EVICT_LOG -.->|Remove from cache| CACHE_QRY
    
    %% Lifecycle Annotations
    Note1[Client Lifecycle:<br/>1. Created on first request<br/>2. Cached for reuse<br/>3. Evicted after 60s idle<br/>4. Recreated on next request]
    Note2[HTTP/2 Benefits:<br/>1. Single TCP connection<br/>2. Stream multiplexing<br/>3. Header compression<br/>4. Server push capability]
    Note3[Health Check Strategy:<br/>1. Lightweight HEAD /health<br/>2. 5s timeout per check<br/>3. 3 failures → evict all<br/>4. Automatic recovery]
    
